<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Dawuro Full Bible Latin Version</book>
  <para style="h">K'olaasiyaasa</para>
  <para style="toc1">P'awuloosi K'olaasiyaasa Asaw S'aafeedda Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">K'olaasiyaasa</para>
  <para style="toc3">K'ol.</para>
  <para style="mt2">P'awuloosi</para>
  <para style="mt1">K'olaasiyaasa Asaw</para>
  <para style="mt2">S'aafeedda Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="imt">Geluwaa</para>
  <para style="ip">P'awuloosi K'olaasiyaasa asaw s'aafeedda kiitay s'aafetteeddawe, Efesoone asaw s'aafetteedda kiitaanna itti wodiyaanna malatee. Hewekka K'eeri Iisiyaan, Efesooneppe away doliyaa baggana beettiyaa K'olaasiyaasan de'iyaa ammaniyaa asatuwaassa gidiide laa"uwaa giddon de'iyaa dummatetsay, K'olaasiyaasa asaw s'aafetteedda kiitay Kiristtoosi med'etaa ubbaw huup'e gidiyaawaa bessiyaa wode Efesoona asaw s'aafetteedda kiitay k'ay Kiristtoosi woosa gollew huup'e gidiyaawaa bessee. Ha asatoo k'aalaa markkatteeddawe P'awuloosa gidana d'ayooppekka, Roome gadiyaan, Iisiyaa waanna katamaa gidiyaa Efesooneppe unttunttoo ootsiyaa asatuwaa kiittiyaawe Aa gidiyaa diraw, K'olaasiyaasawukka aawotiyaa hanotay aw de'ee. K'olaasiyaasa ammaniyaawanttu giddon, «S'oossaa eranawunne kumentsaa atotetsaa demmanaw, Asay ubbay ayaana wolk'k'atoonne maatay de'iyaawanttoo goyinnanaw koshshee» yaagiyaa worddo asttamaaratuu de'iyaawaa P'awuloosi siseedda. Ha asttamaaratuu harabaa k'ay, «Asay ubbaykka k'as's'araa malatiyaa wogatoo moodettanawunne k'umaa wogaanne hara wogatuwaa ubbaa naaganaw koshshee» yaagiino.</para>
  <para style="ip">P'awuloosi ha kiitaa s'aafeeddawe tumanchcha gidiyaa Kiristtinnaa kiitaa odiyaawaan, unttunttu worddo timirttiyaa p'alk'k'anaassa. I zaareedda zaaruwaappe waannatiyaawe «Yesuusi Kiristtoosi kumentsaa atotetsaa immanaw danddayee; ha hara ammanatuunne oosatuu aappe haassanaw danddayiino» yaagiyaawaa. S'oossay Kiristtoosa baggana ha alamiyaa med'd'eedda. K'ay Aa baggana zaariide Aa barekko ahana. Ha alamiyaw Kiristtoosa wozanaappe ammaniyaawaa s'alalaan atotetsaa hidootay de'ee. Hawaa maaran P'awuloosi ha wolk'k'aama timirttii ammaniyaa asaa de'uwaan waaniide oosuwaan peeshanaw danddayintto odee.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha kiitaa P'awuloosappe akkiide, K'olaasiyaasa gatsanaw kiitetteedda Tiikiik'oosanna ittippe beeddawe Anaasimoosa gidiyaawaa be'iyaawe go"iyaawaa. Waaniide gooppe, P'awuloosi ha Anaasimoosa geetettiyaa bare oosanchchaabaa dentsiide, Pilimoonaw hara kiitaa s'aafeedda.</para>
  <para style="iot">Shemppatuwaa Ubbatoo Imetteedda K'antsa K'ofatuwaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Geluwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 1:1-8">1:1-8</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa eeshshaanne oosuwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 1:9-2:19">1:9—2:19</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yesuusan beettiyaa ooratsa de'uwaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 2:20-4:6">2:20—4:6</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wurssetsaa k'utiyaa <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 4:7-18">4:7-18</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Taani P'awuloosi, S'oossaa sheniyaan Kiristtoosi Yesuusi kiitteeddawaa gideeddawenne nu ishay S'imootoosi, <verse eid="COL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />K'olaasiyaasa giyaa katamaan de'iyaa S'oossaa naanaatoo, Kiristtoosan ammanetteeda ishatoo ha dabddaabbiyaa s'aafeetto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">S'oossaa nu Aawuwaappenne Godaa Yesuusi Kiristtoosappe, aad'd'o keekatetsaynne sarotetsay hinttenttoo gido.<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">P'awuloosi Woosseedda Galataa Woosaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Nuuni hinttenttoo woossiidde, nu Godaa Yesuusi Kiristtoosa Aawuwaa, S'oossaa ubbaa wode galateetto. <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />Ayaw gooppe, nuuni Kiristtoosi Yesuusa hinttenttu ammaniyaawaanne S'oossaa asatuwaa ubbaa siik'iyaawaa siseeddo. <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Tumu kiitay wonggalay koyiro hinttekko yeedda wode, S'oossay sintsaappe immana geeddawaa siseeddita. Simmi hinttenttu ammanuunne siik'uu saluwaan giigiide naagiyaa, S'oossay sintsappe immana geeddawan doometteedda. <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />He wonggelii hinttekko gakkeedda; hinttenttu Aa sisoodeppenne S'oossaa aad'd'o keekatetsaa tumatetsaan eroodeppe doommiide, hinttenttu giddon de'iyaawaadankka, biittaa ubbaan anjjuwaa aheenne ubbasaa aakkee.<verse eid="COL 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Hinttenttu hewaa nuunanna ittippe k'ooma gideedda siik'o Eppaafiraappe tamaareeddita; I nu diraw Kiristtoosaw ammanettiide ootsiyaawe, <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />S'oossaa Ayyaanan haratuwaa hinttenttu siik'iyaawaa nuw odeedda.<verse eid="COL 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Hewaa diraw, nuuni k'ay hewaa siseedda gallassaappe doommiide, S'oossay hinttenttoo bare sheniyaa eriyaa eratetsaa, S'oossaa Ayyaanay immiyaa aad'd'eedda eratetsaannanne akeekaana ittippe kuntsiide immanaadan, ubbaa wode balenaan S'oossaa woosseetto. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Hewaappe guyyiyaan, Goday koyyiyaawaadan hinttenttu de'anawunne, ubbaa wode Aa nashechchiyaabaa ootsanaw danddayana; hinttenttu ootsiyaa lo"o oosuwaa ubbaan hinttenttu de'uu go"ana de'iyaawaa gidanawaa; k'ay S'oossaa eriyaawan dic'c'i dic'c'i baanita.<verse eid="COL 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Hinttenttu ubbabaan nashechchan genc'c'anaadaaninne danddayanaadan, S'oossay bare bonchchuwaa gitatetsaadan immiyaa wolk'k'aa ubbaan minnite. <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />K'ay S'oossaa naanaatoo giigeedda poo'o kawutetsaa laattanaw, nuuna danddayisseedda S'oossaa Aawuwaa galatite. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />I nuuna d'umaa wolk'k'aappe ashshiide, bare siik'iyaa Na'aa kawutetsaakko pintseedda. <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />K'ay I bare Na'aan nuuna woziide, nu nagaraa atto geedda.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosa S'oossatetsaanne Aa Oosuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Kiristtoosi beettena S'oossaa k'onc'c'issiyaawaa; I med'etteeddawaa ubbaappe aad'd'iyaa bayira Na'aa. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Ayaw gooppe, ubbabaykka aan med'etteedda; beettiyaawanttu, beettenawanttu, ayyaanatuwaappe beettiyaa wolk'k'aynne godatetsay, d'ok'k'atetsaynne maatay, saluwaaninne sa'aan de'iyaa ubbabaykka Aaninne Aw med'etteedda. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />I ubbabaappe kase de'eedda; ubbabaykka Aan bare sa'aa sa'aa oyk'k'iide de'ee. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />I bare huup'ew, woosa gollew huup'enne de'o; I ubbaappe bolla gidana mala, kasetiide hayk'uwaappe denddeedda Bayira Na'aa gideedda.<verse eid="COL 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Ayaw gooppe, S'oossay koyyeeddawaadan, Aan S'oossatetsaa kumentsay de'ee. <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />Yaatina S'oossay Kiristtoosa baggana ubbabaa barenanna sigetsanaw yewuwaa k'achcheedda; bare Na'ay mask'k'aliyaa bollan gusseedda suutsan saluwaaninne sa'aan de'iyaa ubbabaa barenanna sigetseedda.<verse eid="COL 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Hawaappe kase, hinttenttu iitabaa k'oppeedda dirawunne ootseedda diraw, S'oossaappe shaakettiide, Aanana morkketteeddita. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Shin S'oossay ha"i hinttentta pokkobay bayinnawanttanne k'ay geeshshatuwaa ootsiide, bare sintsa shiishshanaw, bare Na'aa hayk'k'eeddawaa asatetsan barenanna hinttentta sigetseedda. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Hewe hinttenttu tumu ammanuwaan min ek'k'iide, mishiraachchuwaa k'aalaa sisiide, sintsaappe akkana geeddawaappe k'aas's'ennan minniide de'ooppe hanana; he wonggalaa mishiraachchuu sa'aan de'iyaa med'etaa ubbaa matan odetteedda. Taani P'awuloosikka mishiraachchuwaa k'aalaa odiyaawaa gidaaddi.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">P'awuloosi Yesuusi Kiitteeddawaa Gidiide Ootseedda Oosuwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Taani hinttenttoo waayetteedda diraw, ha"i nashettay; Kiristtoosi bare huup'ew, hewaa giyaawe woosa gollew, waayettishin pac'c'eeddawaa taani ta bollaa sakuwaan kuntsay. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />S'oossay taana hinttentta maaddiyaawaanne Aa k'aalaa polaade odiyaa k'oomatetsaa kiitaa taw immeedda. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />Ha k'aalay hawaappe kase bagga ubbaan, asaa ubbaw erettennaan geemmiide de'ee; shin barena ammaniyaawanttoo S'oossay ha"i k'onc'c'isseedda. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />S'oossay Ayihuda gidenna asaw wotseedda ha asaw k'onc'c'ibeenna bonchchuwaanne dure yewuu ayentto geeshshatuwaa erissanaw koyyeedda; ha asaw ha"i k'onc'c'eeddawe ayee gooppe, Kiristtoosi hinttenttun de'iyaawaa; hewaa giyaawe S'oossaa bonchchuwaa aanana hinttenttu akkanawaa.<verse eid="COL 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Hewaa diraw, nuuni asaa ubbaw Kiristtoosawaa odeetto; asaa ubbaa Kiristtoosan kumentsaa asaa ootsiide, S'oossaakko shiishshana mala, nuw aad'd'eedda eratetsaa ubbaan hinttentta seerettonne tamaarisseetto. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Taani hawaa polanaw, taanan ootsiyaa Kiristtoosi taw immiyaa wolk'k'an baas'etaynne daaburay.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Taani hinttenttoonne Lodook'iyaa giyaa katamaan de'iyaa asatoonne k'ay taana be'ibeenna ammaniyaawanttoo ubbatoo ay keenaa baas'etaadditantto hinttenttu erana mala koyyay. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Unttunttu wozanay minnana mala, siik'uwaan ittippe gidiide, tumu akeekan beettiyaa duretetsaa ubbaa unttunttu akkana malanne k'ay unttunttu S'oossay asaw k'onc'c'issibeennawaa, Kiristtoosa Aa huup'ew erana mala, taani daaburay. <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />Geeman S'oossay minjjeedda eraynne aad'd'eedda eratetsay ubbay Aan de'ee.<verse eid="COL 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Ooninne hinttentta c'immiyaa k'aalaan baletsena mala, taani hinttentta hassayissay. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Ayaw gooppe, taani hinttenttu matappe haakkaade de'ooppekka, ayyaanan hinttenttunna de'ay; hinttenttu de'iyaa maaraanne Kiristtoosa hinttenttu minniide ammaniyaawaa be'aade nashettay.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiristtoosan Beettiyaa Kumentsaa De'uwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Simmi hinttenttu Godaa Kiristtoosi Yesuusa akkeeddawaadan, Aan de'ite. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Aan s'ap'uwaa yeddiide dic'c'ite; hinttenttu tamaareeddawaadan ammanuwaan minnite; S'oossaa ubbaa wode galatite.<verse eid="COL 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Kiristtoosappe gidenna timirttiyaan, ha sa'aa mooddiyaa ayyaanatuwaa timirttiyaaninne, asaappe yeedda eratetsan, k'ay mela c'imuwaan hinttentta ooninne omoodenna mala naagettite. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Ayaw gooppe, Kiristtoosa asatetsaa bollan S'oossatetsaa med'etaa kumentsay de'ee. <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />K'ay ubbaa ayyaanatuwaa kaappotetsawunne godatetsaw ubbaw huup'e gidiyaa Kiristtoosappe kumentsaa de'uwaa demmeeddita.<verse eid="COL 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Hinttenttu Kiristtoosanna itti asaa mala gidiide, asaa k'as's'araa mala gidennaan, hinttenttu nagaranchcha med'etaa diggiyaa k'as's'araa, hawekka ashuwaa k'as's'araa gidennaan Kiristtoosi ootseeddawaa. <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />Hinttenttu s'ammak'etteedda wode, Kiristtoosanna moogettiide, Kiristtoosa hayk'uwaappe dentseedda S'oossaa wolk'k'aa ammaneedda diraw, ooratsa de'oo s'ink'k'atan Kiristtoosanna ittippe denddeeddita.<verse eid="COL 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Hinttenttu hinttenttu naak'uwaaninne hinttenttu ec'a asatetsaa k'as's'arettennan aggeeddawan hayk'k'iide de'iyaa wode, S'oossay hinttenttu naak'uwaa atto giide, Kiristtoosanna hinttentta pas'a wotseedda. <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />Nuuna is's'iyaa, ac'uwaa paramaa Aa c'aak'uwaanna ittippe S'oossay daakkeedda; mask'k'aliyaa bollan d'ishiide, ogiyaappe diggeedda. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Kiristtoosi he mask'k'aliyan kaappatuwaappenne godatuwaappe wolk'k'aa wotsi akkiide, bare s'oonuwaanne omoodetteeddawantta k'onc'c'iyaan besseedda.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Hewaa diraw, muussaan woy ushshaan, baalaa gallassaa woy agenay s'eeriyaa wodiyaa bonchchiyaawan, woy Sambbataa bonchchiyaawan, ooninne hinttenttu bolla pirddoppo. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Hawanttu sintsaappe yaana yewatoo eeshuwaa; shin tumatetsay Kiristtoosawaa. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Wordduwaa ashikke malatanawunne kiitanchchaw goyinnanaw koyyiyaawe, be'ibeennawaa sas'aan be'aaddi giide otorettiyaawe, asatetsaa k'ofaan c'oo ayyiyaawe, ooninne hinttenttu bolla pirddoppo. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />Hewaa mala Asay huup'e gidiyaa Kiristtoosa minisi oyk'k'eeddawaa leppissee. Bollaa ubbay he huup'iyaappe wolk'k'aa demmiide, bollan de'iyaa kuriyaannanne s'ap'uwaanna ittippe oyk'k'ettiide, S'oossay dichchiyaa dishuwaadan dic'c'ee.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hayk'uwaankka Pas'ankka Kiristtoosanna De'iyaawaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="COL 2:20-21" />Hinttenttu ha sa'aa mooddiyaa ayyaanatuwaappe haakkiide, Kiristtoosanna hayk'k'eeddita; yaatina, ayaw ha sa'aa wogaan de'iyaa asaadan de'iitee? «Oyk'k'oppa; baara be'oppa; bochchoppa» yaagiyaa higgetoo ayaw azazettiitee? <verse eid="COL 2:20-21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Ha ubbabaykka Asay med'd'eedda higgenne timirtte gidiyaa diraw, wodiyaappe guyyiyaan d'ayana. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Unttunttu kiitanchchaw goyinniyaawaaninne wordduwaa ashikke malatiyaawaan k'ay barenttu asatetsaa gilk'k'issiyaawan aad'd'eedda eranchcha malatiino; shin ashuwaa amuwaa digganaw go"enna.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Simmi hinttenttu Kiristtoosanna hayk'uwaappe denddeeddawaa gidooppe, S'oossaappe ushechcha baggana utteedda Kiristtoosi de'iyaa saan saluwaan de'iyaawaa minisi koyyite. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Saluwaan de'iyaawaa hinttenttu k'oppanaappe attin, sa'aan de'iyaawaa k'oppoppite. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Ayaw gooppe, hinttenttu hayk'k'eeddita; k'ay hinttenttu shemppuu S'oossaan Kiristtoosanna geemmeedda. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Hinttew de'o gideedda Kiristtoosi k'onc'c'iyaa wode, he wode hinttekka aanana bonchchuwaan k'onc'c'ana.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ec'aanne Ooratsa De'uwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Hewaa diraw, hinttenttun de'iyaa ha sa'aa amotuwaa wod'ite; hewanttukka woshummiyaawaa, tunatetsaa, woshummanaw koyiyaawaa, iita amuwaa, miishshaa amottiyaawaa. Yoranchchaa gidussay eek'aw goyinniyaawaappe dummatenna. <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Hawanttu gaasuwaan, S'oossay azazettena asatuwaa hank'k'ettanawaa. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Kase hinttenttu ha iita k'ofatuwaan de'iyaa wode unttunttun moodetteeddita.<verse eid="COL 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Shin ha"i hinttenttu k'ay hank'k'uwaa, yiluwaa, is'uwaa, hinttenttu doonaappe kesiyaa c'ashshaanne yeellayiyaa haasayaa hawantta ubbaa hintteppe d'ayissite. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Ittuu ittoo worddotoppite; ayaw gooppe, nagaranchcha med'etaa Aa oosuwaanna hintteppe d'ayissi diggiide,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:22">Efe. 4:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />S'oossay, Aa med'd'eeddawe, barena malatissanawunne barew de'iyaa eratetsaa ubbaa immanaw, ubbaa wode ooratsiyaa ooratsa med'etaa mayyeeddita.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Dom. 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:24">Efe. 4:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Ha ooratsa med'etaan, Giriike asaa woy Ayihuda asaa, k'as's'aretteeddawaa woy k'as's'arettibeennawaa, imatsatuwaanne ayinne tamaaribeennawaa, ayiliyaa woy womaannuwaa giide shaakkiyaabay baawa; huup'e allaallii Kiristtoosa; I ubbankka de'ee.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Hewaa diraw, S'oossay dooreeddawanttudan, geeshshanne siik'iyaawantta gidiide, maarotetsaa, k'aretaa, keekatetsaa, hinttenttu huup'iyaa kawushshiyaawaa, ashikketetsaanne danddayaa mayyite. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Ittuu ittuwaawaa danddayite; ooninne bare laggiyaa bolla hank'k'etteeddawe de'ooppe, ittuu ittoo atto yaago. Kiristtoosi hinttenttoo atto geeddawaadan, hinttekka atto giite. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Hewaa ubbaa bolla, ubbabaa ittippe shiishshi k'achchiyaa siik'uwaa mayyite. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Kiristtoosi immiyaa sarotetsay hinttentta mooddo; ayaw gooppe, S'oossay hinttentta itti asaa ootsiide, he sarotetsaw s'eeseedda S'oossaa galatite.<verse eid="COL 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Kiristtoosa k'aalay hinttenttu wozanaan kumiide de'o; hinttenttoo de'iyaa aad'd'eedda eratetsaa ubbaan ittuu ittuwaa tamaarissitenne zorite; hinttenttu wozanaan S'oossaa galatiidde, woosaanne mazimuriyaa, S'oossaa suntsaa d'ok'k'u ootsiyaa yetsaa yes's'ite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16-17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:19-20">Efe. 5:19-20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Hintte ay haasayiyaawaa woy ay ootsiyaawaa gidooppekka, Aawuwaa S'oossaa Yesuusa baggana galatiidde, ootsiyaawaa ubbaa Godaa Yesuusa suntsan ootsite.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ammaniyaa Asatuwaa Gollen De'anaw Bessiyaa Wogaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Machchetoo, ammaniyaa asaw bessiyaawaadan, hinttenttu asinaw moodettite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Efe. 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1 P'es'. 3:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Attuma asatoo, hinttenttu mac'c'a asaa siik'ite; unttunttunna woppu giide de'ite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:25">Efe. 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1 P'es'. 3:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Naatoo, hinttentta yeleeddawanttoo ubbabaan azazettite. Ayaw gooppe, hinttenttu unttunttoo azazettiyaawe S'oossaa daro nashechchee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:1">Efe. 6:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Aawotoo, hinttenttu naanay wozanaa bayenna mala, unttuntta yiloyoppite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:4">Efe. 6:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Ayiletoo, sa'aan hinttenttoo godaa gidiyaawanttoo ubbabaan azazettite; Godaw yayyiide, suure wozanaan ootsiteppe attin, asaa nashechchanawunne Asay be'o giyaawaan azazettiyaawantta gidoppite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:5-8">Efe. 6:5-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Hintte ootsiyaa oosuu ubbaa asaw gidennaan Godaw ootsiyaawaadan, wozanaappe ootsite. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Godaa Kiristtoosaw hinttenttu ootsiyaa diraw, I barewanttoo immanaw giigissi wotseeddawaa hinttenttu laattanawaa akeekite. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Balabaa ootseedda uray ooninne, bare ootseedda balaadan woytaa akkana; ayaw gooppe, S'oossay pirddiidde, oonanne maaddenna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:17">Zar. 10:17</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efe. 6:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Godatoo, hinttewukka saluwaan Goday de'iyaawaa eriide, hinttenttu ayiletoo s'illotetsaaninne suuretetsaan koshshiyaawaa ootsite.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zoriyaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />S'oossaa aggenaan woossite; k'ay woossiidde azallenan, Aa galatiidde woossite. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />K'ay hinttenttu woossiyaa wode ubbaan, kaseedeppe asaw k'onc'c'ibeennawaa, Kiristtoosawaa nuuni odana mala, S'oossay nuw injjeyanaadan, nuwukka S'oossaa woossite; ayaw gooppe, ha"i taani k'asho golliyaan de'iyaawe hewaassa. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />K'aykka taani bessiyaawaa keenaa k'onc'c'issaade ha yewuwaa odana mala, taw S'oossaa woossite.<verse eid="COL 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Hinttew de'iyaa wodiyaa go"i bayinnasaan d'ayissennan, ammanennawanttu matan c'inc'c'atetsaan de'ite. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Hinttenttu asaa ubbaw wooti zaaranaw bessintto erana mala, hinttenttu haasayay ubbaa wode, sisanaw lo"iyaawaanne nashechchiyaawaa gidanaw bessee.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wurssetsa Sarotaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Nu siik'o ishay Tikik'oosi, taananna ittippe Godaa oosuwaan k'oomaa gideedda ammanettiyaa oosanchchay, ta de'uwaabaa hinttentta erissana. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Taani Aa hinttekko kiittiyaawe, nuuni waan de'intto hinttenttoo I odiide, hinttentta mentsetsana diraassa. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Anaasimoosi, ammanettiyaa siik'o ishay, hinttenttu gadewe, aanana ittippe hinttekko bee; unttunttu hawaan haniyaa ubbabaa hinttentta erissana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:10-12">Pilm. 10-12</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Taananna k'ashuwaan de'iyaa Ariss's'irokoosinne Barnnaabaasaw aawuwaa gideedda Mark'k'oossi hinttentta sarotiino; taani hinttentta kase azazeeddawaadan, Mark'k'oossi hinttekko booppe, wozanaappe Aa mokkite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Kit. 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27:2</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Pilm. 24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:12">Kit. 12:12</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Yoss's'oosa giyaa Yesuusikka hinttentta saro saro gee; Ayihuda asatuwaappe taananna S'oossaa kawutetsaw ootsiyaawe, ha heezzu asatuwaappe haray baawa; hawanttu taana daro maaddeeddino.<verse eid="COL 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Eppaafiri, hinttenttu gadewe, Kiristtoosi Yesuusa k'oomay, hinttentta saro saro gee. I hinttenttu S'oossaan minniide ek'k'anaadaaninne S'oossay koyyiyaawe ubbay ayentto eriide, poli ammananaadan, ubbaa wode S'oossaa minisi woossee.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:7">K'ol. 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Pilm. 23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Ayaw gooppe, I hinttenttoo, Lodook'iyaa asawunne Hirapoliisa giyaa katamaa asaw daro daaburiyaawaa taani markkattay.<verse eid="COL 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Nu siik'o dottorii Luk'aasinne Deemaasi hinttentta saro de'iitee yaagiino. <verse eid="COL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Lodook'iyaan de'iyaa nu ishatoonne Nimppiw k'ay izi golliyaan shiik'iyaa ammaniyaa asatoo nu sarotaa odite.<verse eid="COL 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Ha dabddaabbiyaa hinttenttu nabbabeeddawaappe guyyiyaan, Lodook'iyaa ammaniyaawanttookka nabbabissite; hinttekka Lodook'iyaa ammaniyaawanttukka hinttenttoo yeddiyaa dabddaabbiyaa nabbabite. <verse eid="COL 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />K'ay Arkkipoosaw, «Goday new immeedda oosuwaa polanawaa dogoppa» yaagiide odite.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:2">Pilm. 2</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Taani P'awuloosi, ta kushiyan sarotaa s'aafeeddawaa hawaa be'ite; taani k'ashuwaan de'iyaawaa dogoppite.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">S'oossaa aad'd'o keekatetsay hinttenttunna gido.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>